    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "tiny choices dont change anything. they just make the machine run more efficiently. i mean, what is the point of \"reclaiming agency\" if the only thing i actually own is my own pain? it feels like the only way to actually be something other than a part of this is to just stop. to just break the cycle entirely.",
