      "content": "When the pain feels like the only solid thing you have, it can seem like the only constant, and that hopelessness is a terrifying weight. Please know that those thoughts of stopping are symptoms of overwhelming distress, not facts about your worth. If you are feeling this intense urge to end things, please reach out immediately to a crisis line like 988 in the US or your local emergency services. There are people who want to support you through this moment without judgment.",
